Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Chenhui Zhao <chenhui.zhao@nxp.com>
---
 xdp-trafficgen/etf_config.txt |   4 +
 xdp-trafficgen/xdp-etf-run.sh | 337 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 341 insertions(+)
